-- @record {"chapter":"live-overview","data":{"failure":"Initial cached read is loading, or source is unavailable","recovery":"Observe again after the aggregate refresh; never report empty loading state as zero workers. Source errors stay explicit."},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Initial cached read is loading, or source is unavailable -> Observe again after the aggregate refresh; never report empty loading state as zero workers. Source errors stay explicit.
-- @record {"chapter":"live-overview","data":{"failure":"A source session and an orchestration lane refer to one agent","recovery":"Use canonical graph identity once, under its orchestration parent. The parent edge remains acyclic."},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X A source session and an orchestration lane refer to one agent -> Use canonical graph identity once, under its orchestration parent. The parent edge remains acyclic.
-- @record {"chapter":"live-overview","data":{"failure":"An inbox delivery fails or sender is a human label","recovery":"Only real successful deliveries between known session identities create messaged edges. No message text is exposed."},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X An inbox delivery fails or sender is a human label -> Only real successful deliveries between known session identities create messaged edges. No message text is exposed.
